# Force LF line endings for all text files on checkout, regardless of the
# host's core.autocrlf setting. Prettier is configured with endOfLine: lf
# (see .prettierrc.json), so without this Windows runners would fail
# `prettier --check` after checkout converts files to CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary types — never normalize.
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.jpeg   binary
*.gif    binary
*.ico    binary
*.ttf    binary
*.woff   binary
*.woff2  binary
*.zip    binary
*.tgz    binary
